1
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:07,090
Joey? Are you in there?
喬伊，你在嗎？

2
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,860
-That's Rachel. -You have to talk to her.
-是瑞秋 -你得跟她談一談

3
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:13,800
I can't. Not after the other night. It's too weird.
不行，經過那晚的事之後 感覺真的太奇怪了

4
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:16,000
Don't tell her I'm here.
別告訴她我在這裡

5
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:19,550
Don't eat that!
別吃那個

6
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:22,180
-Hey! -Hey, Rachel.
-嘿 -嘿，瑞秋

7
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:23,870
Is Joey here?
喬伊在嗎？

8
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:26,180
-I don't see him. You? -No.
-我沒有看到他，你呢？ -沒有

9
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:29,850
Maybe he's in the sugar bowl. Joey? Nope.
或許他在糖碗裡 喬伊？沒有

10
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:33,750
Well, at least you make each other laugh.
至少 你們能逗彼此笑

11
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:37,820
-What's up? -I haven't seen him since he said..
-怎麼了？ -我一直沒見過他，自從他說…

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,660
how he, you know..
他怎麼…你們知道的…

13
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:42,500
I don't know, I think he's avoiding me.
我不知道 我想他在避我

14
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:45,430
Why is that bagel on the floor?
為什麼地板上會有貝果？

15
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:49,670
-We were playing a game. -Was Chandler naked?
-我們在玩遊戲？ -錢德沒穿衣服嗎？

16
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:55,150
Sort of like a ring-toss kind of situation?
像是在玩 套圈圈遊戲嗎？

17
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,910
-Sure! -What? No! No!
-沒錯 -什麼？不

18
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:04,590
All right, listen. If you see Joey, will you just tell him that..?
好吧，聽著，如果你們看到喬伊 能不能告訴他…

19
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:06,590
Tell him I miss him.
告訴他我很想他

20
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:15,970
-Okay. Did you hear that? -Yeah. That naked bagel game?
-好吧，你聽到了嗎？ -是啊，裸體貝果遊戲？

21
00:01:18,570 --> 00:01:22,240
Dude, I don't know. That's a pretty small hole.
我不知道 那個洞真的很小

22
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:26,440
-You've gotta talk to her. -I can't.
-你得跟她談一談 -我沒辦法

23
00:01:26,610 --> 00:01:30,880
You guys don't know what it's like to get shot down.
你們不知道 被拒絕的感覺有多難受

24
00:01:31,050 --> 00:01:33,320
I don't know what that's like?
我不知道那種感覺？

25
00:01:33,490 --> 00:01:38,430
Until I was 25, I thought the response to "I love you" was "Oh, crap."
我在25歲前一直以為 「我愛你」的反應是「喔，天啊」

26
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:39,920
No rejection?
我沒有被拒絕過？

27
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:43,290
I got shot down at fat camp.
我在減肥營時被拒絕過

28
00:01:44,430 --> 00:01:47,700
Boy, kids are mean when they're hungry.
天啊，飢餓的孩子們 真的很殘忍

29
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:51,070
So, what do I do?
我該怎麼辦？

30
00:01:51,270 --> 00:01:54,470
It's Rachel. You're gonna never talk to her again?
她是瑞秋 你永遠都不要跟她說話嗎？

31
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:58,810
It's weird and it's awkward, but you gotta at least try.
那很奇怪，也很可怕 但至少你得試試看

32
00:01:58,980 --> 00:02:01,780
Yeah, okay.
好吧

33
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:04,680
I forgot this was on your..
我忘了這個曾套在你的…

34
00:02:04,850 --> 00:02:07,250
We didn't play it!
我們沒有玩它

35
00:02:08,228 --> 00:02:10,355
The One With The Tea Leaves
本集播出：茶葉算命法

00:02:11,228 --> 00:02:12,355
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

36
00:02:43,563 --> 00:02:45,895
（中央公園 咖啡館）

37
00:02:46,590 --> 00:02:50,000
I'll look at your tea leaves and tell your fortune.
我會看你們的茶葉 幫你們算命

38
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:53,260
-You read tea leaves? -I've done it for years.
-你會茶葉算命法？ -我這麼做有好幾年

39
00:02:53,430 --> 00:02:56,700
I actually stopped because I was so accurate.
後來我放棄 因為我算得太準了

40
00:02:56,870 --> 00:02:59,340
And one of the great joys of life..
生命的樂趣 之一…

41
00:02:59,510 --> 00:03:02,600
is its wondrous unpredictability, you know?
就是 不可預測性

42
00:03:02,780 --> 00:03:05,750
And also, tea tends to give me the trots.
還有 茶葉會讓我拉肚子

43
00:03:06,410 --> 00:03:09,650
-Okay. I'm done. Read mine. -Okay.
-我好了，幫我算吧 -好的

44
00:03:10,590 --> 00:03:13,080
I see a ladder.
我看見一個梯子

45
00:03:13,250 --> 00:03:17,160
Which can mean either a promotion or a violent death.
它的意思不是升職 就是暴力死亡

46
00:03:20,930 --> 00:03:23,860
I'm the head chef. I can't get promoted.
我是主廚 我不可能被升職

47
00:03:24,930 --> 00:03:26,560
Who's next?
下一個是誰？

48
00:03:27,770 --> 00:03:29,360
I'm done. Do mine.
我好了，幫我算

49
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:31,000
Okay.
好吧

50
00:03:31,770 --> 00:03:34,540
Oh! Okay, I see a circle.
好吧，我看到一個圈圈

51
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:38,440
Which can either mean you're having a baby..
那表示 你懷了孩子

52
00:03:38,650 --> 00:03:41,410
or you'll make a scientific discovery!
或你會做出科學發現

53
00:03:41,580 --> 00:03:46,150
Well, I have been spending a lot of time in the lab.
我一直都待在實驗室裡

54
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:50,580
-What does yours say, Pheebs? -All right.
-你的茶葉又告訴你什麼呢？菲比 -好吧

55
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:53,180
Wow! Yay!
哇，耶

56
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:57,560
Oh, I'm gonna meet a guy! And really soon!
我會認識一個男人 而且很快

57
00:03:57,730 --> 00:04:00,100
He's gonna be the man of my dreams.
他會是我的夢中情人

58
00:04:00,270 --> 00:04:04,170
Probably not the guy I had a dream about last night.
或許他不是 我昨晚夢到的那個男人

59
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:10,140
Has anyone seen my shirt?
有人看到我的襯衫嗎？

60
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:13,970
It's a button-down, like a faded salmon color?
它是前開式的襯衫 淡鮭魚色

61
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:16,450
You mean your pink shirt?
你是說你的粉紅色襯衫嗎？

62
00:04:17,390 --> 00:04:19,320
Faded salmon color?
淡鮭魚色？

63
00:04:19,490 --> 00:04:22,050
No, I haven't seen your pink shirt.
不，我沒有看到你的粉紅色襯衫

64
00:04:22,690 --> 00:04:25,890
I must have left it at Mona's. I knew it!
我一定把它丟在蒙娜家了 我就知道

65
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:29,460
I'm sure you can get another one at Ann Taylor's.
我想你可以到安泰勒的專賣店 再買一件

66
00:04:30,970 --> 00:04:33,660
That's my favorite shirt. I love it.
它是我最喜歡的襯衫 我愛它

67
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,830
Ask Mona to give it back.
請蒙娜把它還給你

68
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,840
I don't know. I could.
我不知道，或許吧

69
00:04:38,010 --> 00:04:41,600
We didn't really end things on good terms.
我們不算是 好聚好散

70
00:04:41,780 --> 00:04:45,910
If I went, I'd be ignoring the one thing she asked me to do..
我想去她家 就得忘了她告訴我的一件事…

71
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:48,840
jump up my own ass and die.
她要我去跳樓自殺

72
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:55,010
Oh, wait a second, you guys?
等一下

73
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:58,350
I've been seeing that guy everywhere I go.
我走到哪裡 都會看到那個男人

74
00:04:58,530 --> 00:05:02,020
We take the same bus, go to the same bookstore.
我們搭同一班公車 去同一家書局

75
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,890
Maybe he's the tea guy.
或許他就是我的真命天子

76
00:05:07,300 --> 00:05:08,630
Did you see that?
你們看到了嗎？

77
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:12,530
He totally checked you out! And he is so cute!
他真的在看你 而且他很帥

78
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:20,210
Mine is a picture of the Village People. What does that mean?
我的茶葉出現鄉巴佬的圖案 那是什麼意思？

79
00:05:24,250 --> 00:05:25,740
Hi.
嗨

80
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,620
Hey.
嘿

81
00:05:39,570 --> 00:05:42,200
-Hi. -Hi.
-嗨 -嗨

82
00:05:50,350 --> 00:05:53,210
Tea gives Phoebe the trots!
茶葉讓菲比拉肚子

83
00:06:00,150 --> 00:06:02,820
I thought Joey and l would be okay..
我以為 喬伊跟我可以不尷尬…

84
00:06:02,990 --> 00:06:05,580
but we don't know how to be together.
但我們不知道該怎麼相處

85
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,660
By the way, I've been meaning to say this.
還有 我一直都想這麼說

86
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:10,660
If you guys knew about this, a heads-up would have been nice.
如果你們知道這件事 我真的很希望你們提醒我一下

87
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:12,490
Just a little, you know.
只要給點提示就夠了

88
00:06:12,670 --> 00:06:14,360
"Joey loves you. Be prepared."
「喬伊愛你 做好準備」

89
00:06:15,700 --> 00:06:18,400
-Sorry. -Well, for next time.
-抱歉 -下次別再犯了

90
00:06:19,370 --> 00:06:23,400
-It's tough, but things will improve. -How do you know?
-那真的很難，但情況會有改善的 -你怎麼知道？

91
00:06:23,580 --> 00:06:26,050
What if it gets worse and worse..
如果情況惡化…

92
00:06:26,210 --> 00:06:30,010
to the point where we can't be in the same room?
我們無法共處一室呢？

93
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:32,410
I'm not great at the advice.
我不善於給好建議

94
00:06:32,590 --> 00:06:36,050
Can I interest you in a sarcastic comment?
要我諷刺你一下嗎？

95
00:06:37,060 --> 00:06:39,420
Some cheese?
要起司嗎？

96
00:06:42,130 --> 00:06:46,430
Honey, why is the Bruce Springsteen CD in the Cat Stevens case?
甜心，為什麼布魯斯史普林斯汀的CD 會放在凱特史帝文斯的盒子裡？

97
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:50,540
If I can't find the right case, I use the nearest one.
如果我找不到正確的盒子 我會隨手拿一個盒子來裝

98
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:54,430
-Where is the Cat Stevens CD? -The James Taylor case.
-凱特史帝文斯的CD在哪裡？ -詹姆士泰勒的盒子裡

99
00:06:54,610 --> 00:06:57,370
-Where is that CD? -I'll save you time.
-那張CD在哪裡？ -我幫你節省一些時間

100
00:06:57,550 --> 00:07:01,140
Two hundred CDs, not one of them in the right case.
那200張CD 沒有一張放在正確的盒子裡

101
00:07:02,050 --> 00:07:06,680
Okay. No need to panic. Deep breaths, everyone.
好吧，不需要慌張 大家深呼吸

102
00:07:06,850 --> 00:07:10,480
We'll just have to put the CDs in their right cases.
我們只需要把CD 放在正確的盒子裡

103
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:14,960
If we do that, we should come up with some kind of order.
那麼做的話 應該能將CD排好

104
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:17,590
We have to talk this through.
我們得談一談這件事

105
00:07:17,770 --> 00:07:23,830
Oh, my God, you have such problems! I feel so terrible for you!
天啊，你們真的有問題 我為你們感到難過

106
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:26,640
All right. Okay, I'm sorry.
好吧，對不起

107
00:07:26,810 --> 00:07:30,140
You're both focusing on this uncomfortable thing.
你們兩個 滿腦子都是這件令人不舒服的事

108
00:07:30,310 --> 00:07:32,280
Change the subject.
改變一下話題

109
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:35,580
Get him talking about something else.
讓他談別的事

110
00:07:35,750 --> 00:07:37,340
Yeah, that makes sense.
對，那挺有道理的

111
00:07:37,550 --> 00:07:40,820
Maybe you need his advice on a work problem..
或許你在工作上有問題 需要他的建議…

112
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:42,950
-I could do that. -Good.
-我可以那麼做 -很好

113
00:07:43,990 --> 00:07:46,430
The Miami Vice soundtrack? Really?
邁阿密天龍的原聲帶？ 真的嗎？

114
00:07:46,630 --> 00:07:49,860
They were just giving those away at the store.
那是唱片行的贈品

115
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:53,130
In exchange for money.
我得拿錢去換

116
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:57,160
Hey.
嘿

117
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:04,470
I really don't know what to tell you.
我真的不知道該跟你說什麼

118
00:08:04,650 --> 00:08:09,280
Maybe Joey could help you out with your big work problem.
或許喬伊可以幫你 解決工作上的大問題

119
00:08:10,590 --> 00:08:12,780
-What? -Yeah, Joey, she's..
-什麼？ -對，喬伊，她…

120
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:17,790
Rachel's got this big work problem. It is a head-scratcher.
瑞秋工作上有個大問題 那真的很傷腦筋

121
00:08:17,960 --> 00:08:22,900
Know what? If we're gonna make dinner, we're gonna have to leave.
你知道嗎？我們想趕上晚餐預約 就得馬上出發

122
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:25,460
Yeah, Joey, maybe you could help her out.
對，喬伊 或許你可以幫她

123
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:27,300
-Okay. -Oh, and you know what?
-好吧 -你知道嗎？

124
00:08:27,470 --> 00:08:29,370
While you're helping solve this problem..
你幫忙 解決這個問題時…

125
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:33,530
you might want to do something with your hands. Like, off the top of my head..
或許你想手邊找些事來說 我是不小心想到的…

126
00:08:33,710 --> 00:08:35,970
maybe put the CDs in their right cases.
譬如說將CD 放到正確的盒子裡

127
00:08:36,610 --> 00:08:38,200
Here we go.
來吧

128
00:08:40,410 --> 00:08:43,750
So you have a big work problem?
你工作上出了大問題？

129
00:08:44,750 --> 00:08:47,080
Yeah. It's, uh..
對，那是…

130
00:08:47,260 --> 00:08:49,490
Yeah, it's, uh..
對，那是…

131
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:54,460
You know, it's nothing.
真的沒什麼

132
00:08:55,430 --> 00:08:56,950
Okay.
好吧

133
00:09:00,540 --> 00:09:03,300
So I think I'm gonna take off.
我想我該走了

134
00:09:03,470 --> 00:09:08,030
No, wait, Joey, it is. It's something. It's..
不，喬伊，等一下，我有問題 它真的很嚴重，是…

135
00:09:08,210 --> 00:09:09,800
It's my boss.
是我的老闆

136
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:13,040
-Yeah? -Yeah. And, uh..
-是嗎？ -對，跟…

137
00:09:14,650 --> 00:09:16,640
And my baby.
跟我的寶寶

138
00:09:17,250 --> 00:09:18,380
Yeah?
是嗎？

139
00:09:19,690 --> 00:09:22,520
My boss wants to buy my baby.
我老闆想買我的寶寶

140
00:09:24,290 --> 00:09:27,690
What? Oh, my God!
什麼？我的天啊

141
00:09:27,860 --> 00:09:31,060
I know, I told you, it's a really big problem!
我知道，我跟你說過了 這真的是個大問題

142
00:09:31,370 --> 00:09:35,030
-He wants to buy your baby? -Can you believe that?
-他要買你的寶寶？ -你能相信嗎？

143
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:38,030
-That's crazy. -That's what I told him!
-那太瘋狂了 -我就是那麼跟他說的

144
00:09:38,210 --> 00:09:41,900
-How did this even happen? -Well, I'll tell you.
-怎麼會發生這種事？ -我會告訴你

145
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:49,940
See, my boss and his wife, they can't have children, so..
我老闆跟他太太 他們不孕，所以…

146
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:53,550
And then when we were at the Christmas party..
在耶誕派對上 我們碰到了面…

147
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:58,320
he got drunk and said to me, "Rachel, I want to buy your baby."
他喝醉了跟我說 「瑞秋，我要買下你的寶寶」

148
00:09:58,590 --> 00:10:02,930
When you said it was a problem about your boss and the baby..
你說你老闆跟寶寶 有問題的時候…

149
00:10:03,100 --> 00:10:05,960
I figured it was about maternity leave.
我以為 你是指產假的問題

150
00:10:06,130 --> 00:10:09,260
Oh. Yeah.
對

151
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:23,210
Yeah, that would have been a much simpler problem.
對，那樣子 問題簡單多了

152
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:33,790
-Oh, hello. -Oh, it's you. I see you everywhere.
-哈囉 -是你，我走到哪裡都會碰到你

153
00:10:34,530 --> 00:10:36,000
I'm Jim. Jim Nelson.
我是吉米，吉米尼爾森

154
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:40,100
Hi, Jim-Jim Nelson. I'm Phoebe-Phoebe Buffay.
嗨，吉米吉米尼爾森 我是菲比菲比布非

155
00:10:40,270 --> 00:10:43,070
-We've seen each other a lot lately. -Yes.
-我們最近常見面 -對

156
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:48,110
Maybe we'll see each other at dinner tomorrow. Around 8:00?
或許明天晚餐時我們也能碰面 八點可以嗎？

157
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:51,240
Well, maybe we will.
或許會吧

158
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,610
Mona?
蒙娜

159
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:30,120
Okay, if I were a salmon shirt, where would I be?
如果我是鮭魚色襯衫 我會在哪裡？

160
00:11:30,450 --> 00:11:31,980
Upstream.
上游

161
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,960
Damn, nobody's here for my good ones.
